{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_object_is_and_zero_page", "label": "16 \u00b7 Object.is, -0 and Infinity", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-1-values-and-coercion/object-is-and-zero.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_object_is_and_zero_object_is", "label": "Object.is / SameValue", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-1-values-and-coercion/object-is-and-zero.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fourth equality algorithm: === with NaN treated equal and 0 vs -0 treated unequal. React uses it so NaN state does not re-render forever. Everyday code still uses ===."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_object_is_and_zero_samevaluezero", "label": "SameValueZero", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-1-values-and-coercion/object-is-and-zero.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_object_is_and_zero_signed_zero", "label": "Signed zero -0", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-1-values-and-coercion/object-is-and-zero.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "IEEE-754 signed zero from underflow, 0*-1, or Math.round(-0.2). Invisible under ===, String, JSON. Detect with Object.is(x,-0) or 1/x === -Infinity. Matters for Math.atan2 and Object.is deep-equals."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_1_values_and_coercion_object_is_and_zero_infinity", "label": "I